    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. Risk-free ~4.3% (10y UST), ERP 5.0%, beta ~0.9 (staples beverage alcohol with discretionary premium-import tilt) -> cost of equity ~8.8%. Pre-tax debt ~4.6% (mostly fixed-rate senior notes), ~3.6% after tax. Market weights: ~$10.5B debt vs ~$19.3B equity (35/65) -> ~7.0%; rounded up to 7.5% for single-country (Mexico) production and trade-policy exposure. Same WACC in every scenario: demand and tariff risk are carried in the scenario paths and the 25% bear weight, not stacked on the rate.",
